e it in turns to give instructions about doing an action somewhere in relation to the box, e.g.:\n<ul>\n<li>Jump up and down in the box.</li>\n<li>Crawl round the box.</li>\n<li>Clap your hands next to the box.</li>\n<li>Growl inside the box.</li>\n</ul>\n<br></br>\n<h2>Extra challenge:</h2>\nTake it in turns to give instructions about what do with an object somewhere in relation to the box, e.g.:\n<ul>\n<li>Make the teddy jump up and down in the box.</li>\n<li>Sit on a cushion next to the box.</li>\n<li>Use a spoon to pretend you are digging a hole in the box.</li>\n<li>Turn the box upside-down and pretend the cat is sleeping on top of the box.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 36465120, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 36465446, "text": "Take it in turns to give instructions about doing an action somewhere in relation to the box, e.g.:\n<ul>\n<li>Jump up and down in the box.</li>\n<li>Crawl round the box.</li>\n<li>Clap your hands next to the box.</li>\n<li>Growl inside the box.</li>\n</ul>\n<br></br>\n<h2>Extra challenge:</h2>\nTake it in turns to give instructions about what do with an object somewhere in relation to the box, e.g.:\n<ul>\n<li>Make the teddy jump up and down in the box.</li>\n<li>Sit on a cushion next to the box.</li>\n<li>Use a spoon to pretend you are digging a hole in the box.</li>\n<li>T